.SH NAME
SystemEx.Runtime.Module \- Represents a loaded native module (DLL, SO, or DYLIB)\&. 
.br
 A \fBModule\fP encapsulates the operating system handle of the loaded library and provides helper methods for resolving exported functions and unloading the module\&.  

